FIELDS USER PROVIDES (via Voice/Text during FNOL)

policy_number - User provides this at the very beginning
incident_date - User tells agent when incident happened
incident_location - User describes where it happened
loss_type - User describes what happened (collision, theft etc.)
damage_description - User describes the damage
estimated_loss_amount - User estimates the damage cost
third_party_involved - User says yes or no
third_party_details - User provides other party info if involved
police_report_number - User provides if they filed a report
contact_number - User provides
email - User provides

FIELDS AUTO-FETCHED FROM DATABASE

These are fetched automatically using the policy_number the user provided above:

From motor_policy_details table:

policyholder_name

From motor_vehicle_details table:

vehicle_make
vehicle_model
vehicle_year
license_plate
vin
driver_name
driver_license

ALL OF THE ABOVE GETS SAVED TO:

motor_fnol_submissions table
